  Description: Prerequisite Region - Saga Lands You have little love or trust for
    spellcraft and those who practice it, and have developed a paranoid knack for
    recognizing such tricks. You are constantly on guard for the magic of witches
    and have been trained to spot the signs of those with minds affected by magic.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Intelligence , and one
    is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Occultism skill and the Curse
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Oddity Identification]
    skill feat.
